.121569 .160784 .2 rg
BT 1 0 0 1 0 30.2 Tm /F2+0 9.1 Tf 13.1 TL (A strong private key is not guessable through ordinary online password attempts, and the server does not need the private) Tj T* (key. Keys can be unique per device, revoked individually, protected by a passphrase or hardware, and constrained in) Tj T* (authorized_keys. Key authentication still needs secure storage, host verification, and lifecycle management.) Tj T* ET
