BT 1 0 0 1 0 30.2 Tm /F2+0 9.1 Tf 13.1 TL (A reverse proxy is the server-side entry point that accepts client requests, selects a backend, forwards the request, and) Tj T* (returns the backend response. It can centralize TLS, routing, request limits, static content, buffering, and load balancing) Tj T* (while keeping application ports private.) Tj T* ET
